            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# CodexMate 0.0.53

- Keeps live thread status icons accurate when a new task starts after a completed turn.
- Speeds up status refreshes for large thread histories by incrementally reading newly appended session events.
- Skips oversized compaction records without losing nearby task state.
